# Beast 3.0 Legal Framework Division

The Legal Framework Division provides the constitutional, statutory, and contractual foundation for the New World Order Private Government DAO LLC and the Beast 3.0 ecosystem.

## Mission

Establish immutable constitutional anchors, verifiable legal templates, and transparent governance statutes that govern automated resource allocation and institutional operations.

## Core Responsibilities

- Digital Constitution Engine & Article Indexing
- Smart Contract Legal Template Management
- Legislative Clause Structuring & Ratification
- Judicial Audit Standards & Compliance Verification

## Connected Systems

- Legislative Assembly Division (`div-02-legislative`)
- Judicial & Audit Division (`div-03-judicial`)
- Executive Administration Division (`div-01-executive`)

## Status

Development
